{"id": "22-926-2-2", "zh": "mana 等词群", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-927-2-6", "zh": "116. 在 kodha 等词之后。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-928-2-7", "zh": "在这些词之后，nā 语尾可以变为 sā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-929-2-9", "zh": "例如 kodhasā、kodhena，atthasā、atthena。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-930-2-20", "zh": "117. nā 变为 sā［ka.181；rū.95；nī.373］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-931-2-7", "zh": "在 pada 等词之后，nā 语尾可以变为 sā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-932-2-9", "zh": "例如 padasā、padena，bilasā、bilena。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-933-2-8", "zh": "118. 在 pada 等词之后变为 si。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-934-2-7", "zh": "在 pada 等词之后，smiṃ 语尾可以变为 si。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-935-2-9", "zh": "例如 padasi、pade，bilasi、bile。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-936-2-8", "zh": "其中，kodha 等词是阳性，pada 等词是中性。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-936-9-64", "zh": "其中有些词在复合词与次级派生词（taddhita）的中间以 o 结尾，例如 āpodhātu、āpomayaṃ、vāyodhātu、vāyomayaṃ，以及“jīva tvaṃ saradosataṃ”（愿你活过一百个秋天）［jā.1.2.9］、“anuyanti disodisaṃ”（追随到各个方向）［dī.ni.3.281］，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-937-2-75", "zh": "有些词的 nā 也会得到 sā 作替代，例如“kodhasā usunā vijjhi”（他愤怒地用箭射）［jā.2.22.352］、“daḷhaṃ gaṇhāhi thāmasā”（用力牢牢抓住）［jā.1.7.30］、“padasāva agamāsi”（他步行而去）、“mākāsi mukhasā pāpaṃ”（不要用嘴造恶）、“saccena danto damasā upeto”（以真实而调伏，具足调伏）——damasā 就是“以调伏诸根”的意思，“suciṃ paṇītaṃ rasasā upetaṃ”（清净、精美、具足滋味）［jā.1.7.18］、“vegasā gantvāna”（迅速地前往）、“āyusā ekaputtamanurakkhe”（像以生命守护独子一样）［khu.pā.9.7］，等等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-938-2-11", "zh": "有些词的 smiṃ 会得到 si 作替代，例如 padasi、bilasi 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-939-2-38", "zh": "有些语法家依大规则（mahāvutti），把 nā 与 smā 变为 so，例如 atthaso、akkharaso、suttaso、byañjanaso、hetuso、yoniso、upāyaso、ṭhānaso、dīghaso、oraso、bahuso、puthuso、mattaso、bhāgaso 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-940-2-32", "zh": "但在“padaso dhammaṃ vāceyya”（逐句教授法）［pāci.45］、“bilaso vibhajitvā nisinno assa”（分成份后坐着）［dī.ni.2.378］等句中，so 是表示分配（vicchā）的词缀。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-941-2-61", "zh": "而当复合词末尾依大规则在 si 等格尾前加入插音 s（sāgama）时，这个词也就归入 purisa 等词群，例如 byāsattamanaso、abyaggamanaso［a.ni.3.29］、“putto jāto acetaso”（生下一个没有心智的儿子）［jā.2.22.4］、sumedhaso［a.ni.4.62］、bhūrimedhaso［su.ni.1137］，等等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-942-2-4", "zh": "以上是 mana 等词群。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-943-2-2", "zh": "guṇavā 等词群", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-944-2-19", "zh": "119. ntu 的变化［ka.124；rū.98；nī.299］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-945-2-7", "zh": "在 si 之前，ntu 变为 ṭā（即 ā）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-946-2-4", "zh": "Guṇavā tiṭṭhati（有德者站着）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-947-2-20", "zh": "120. 在 yo 等格尾之前，ntu 的变化［ka.92；rū.100；nī.249］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-948-2-6", "zh": "在 yo 等格尾之前，ntu 变为以 a 结尾（即 nta）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-949-2-4", "zh": "Guṇavantā tiṭṭhanti（有德者们站着）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-950-2-22", "zh": "121. 在第一格的 yo 之前，nta 与 ntu 变为 nto［ka.92；rū.100；nī.249］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-951-2-10", "zh": "在第一格的 yo 之前，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾一起变为 nto。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-952-2-4", "zh": "Guṇavanto tiṭṭhanti（有德者们站着）。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-953-2-20", "zh": "122. 在呼格 ga 之前变为 ṭa、ṭā、aṃ［ka.126；rū.101；nī.301-2］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-954-2-14", "zh": "在后面接呼格 ga 时，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾一起变为 ṭa、ṭā、aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-955-2-22", "zh": "例如 bho guṇava、bho guṇavā、bho guṇavaṃ（有德者啊），bhonto guṇavantā、bhonto guṇavanto（有德者们啊），guṇavantaṃ、guṇavante、guṇavantena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-956-2-26", "zh": "123. 在 sa、smā、smiṃ、nā 之前变为 to、tā、ti、tā［ka.127,187；rū.102,108；nī.303,386］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-957-2-23", "zh": "在 sa、smā、smiṃ、nā 之前，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾可以依次变为 to、tā、ti、tā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-958-2-11", "zh": "例如 guṇavatā、guṇavantehi、guṇavantebhi、guṇavantassa、guṇavato。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-959-2-22", "zh": "124. 在 naṃ 之前可以变为 taṃ［ka.128；rū.104；nī.304］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-960-2-10", "zh": "在 naṃ 之前，nta 与 ntu 连同格尾可以变为 taṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-961-2-35", "zh": "例如 guṇavantānaṃ、guṇavataṃ，guṇavantasmā、guṇavantamhā、guṇavantā、guṇavatā，guṇavantehi、guṇavantebhi，guṇavantassa、guṇavato，guṇavantānaṃ、guṇavataṃ，guṇavantasmiṃ、guṇavantamhi、guṇavati、guṇavante，guṇavantesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-962-2-19", "zh": "同样变化的还有 bhagavā、sīlavā、paññavā、balavā、dhanavā、vaṇṇavā、bhogavā、sutavā 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-962-20-26", "zh": "这里要注意，在呼格中 bhagavā 一律是长音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-963-2-19", "zh": "例如 sabbāvā、sabbāvanto、sabbāvantaṃ、sabbāvante、sabbāvantena、sabbāvatā、sabbāvantehi……乃至……sabbāvantesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-964-2-23", "zh": "同样变化的还有 yāvā、yāvanto，tāvā、tāvanto，ettāvā、ettāvanto，kiṃvā、kiṃvanto，kittāvā、kittāvanto 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-964-24-41", "zh": "同样还有 bhojanaṃ bhuttavā、bhuttavanto（吃过饭的人），dhammaṃ buddhavā、buddhavanto（觉悟了法的人），kammaṃ katavā、katavanto（做完了事的人）等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-965-2-72", "zh": "例如 satimā，satimantā、satimanto，bho satima、bho satimā、bho satimaṃ，bhonto satimantā、bhonto satimanto，satimantaṃ、satimante，satimantena、satimatā，satimantehi、satimantebhi，satimantassa、satimato，satimantānaṃ、satimataṃ，satimantasmā、satimantamhā、satimantā、satimatā，satimantehi、satimantebhi，satimantassa、satimato，satimantānaṃ、satimataṃ，satimantasmiṃ、satimantamhi、satimati、satimante，satimantesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-966-2-42", "zh": "同样变化的还有 matimā、gatimā、pāpimā、jātimā、bhāṇumā、āyumā、āyasmā、sirimā、hirimā、dhitimā、kittimā、iddhimā、jutimā、mutimā、thutimā、buddhimā、cakkhumā、bandhumā、gomā 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-967-2-3", "zh": "下面说特殊规则。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-968-2-21", "zh": "125. himavanta 可以变为 o［ka.94；rū.105；nī.252］。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-969-2-7", "zh": "在 si 之前，himavanta 一词（的末尾）可以变为 o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-969-8-13", "zh": "再依“gasīnaṃ”规则删去 si。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-970-2-14", "zh": "例如 himavanto pabbato（雪山）［dha.pa.304］、himavā pabbato。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-971-2-22", "zh": "126. 在 aṃ、sa 之前，nta 也可以变为 ṭa［ka.93；rū.106；nī.251］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-972-2-13", "zh": "在 aṃ、sa 之前，nta 与 ntu 都可以整体变为 ṭa（即 a）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-973-2-20", "zh": "圣典中有“ajjhogāhetvā himavan”（深入雪山之后）［apa.thera 2.47.59］这样的用例。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-973-21-30", "zh": "例如 satimaṃ、bandhumaṃ、guṇavassa、satimassa、bandhumassa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-974-2-82", "zh": "依大规则，有时在 si 和呼格 ga 之前，ntu 也会变为以 a 结尾（即 nta），圣典中有“atulo nāma nāmena, paññavanto jutindharo”（名字叫作阿图罗，有智慧而放光明）［bu.vaṃ.21.10］、“gatimanto satimanto, dhitimanto ca yo isī”（那位有行持、有正念、有毅力的仙人）［theragā.1052］、“cakkhumanto mahāyaso”（具眼者，有大名声）以及“tuyhaṃ pitā mahāvīra, paññavanta jutindharā”（大雄啊，你的父亲，有智慧而放光明者啊）［apa.therī 2.2.389］这些用例。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-975-2-70", "zh": "在第一格 yo 之前，有时 ntu 变为 ṭa，例如“vaggumudātīriyā pana bhikkhū vaṇṇavā honti”（而住在婆求河岸的比丘们容光焕发）［pārā.194］、“etha tumhe āvuso sīlavā hotha”（来吧，朋友们，你们要持守戒律）［a.ni.5.114］、“cakkhumā andhakā honti, ye itthīnaṃ vasaṃ gatā”（那些受女人支配的人，有眼也成了瞎子）［jā.aṭṭha.2.3.36］、“saṃsuddhapaññā kusalā mutimā bhavanti”（他们智慧清净、善巧而有觉知）［su.ni.887（saṃsuddhapaññā kusalā mutīmā）］。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-976-2-4", "zh": "以上是 guṇavā 等词群。", "confidence": 90}
